#: {{usex|en|I '''got''' ski.|I '''went''' skiing.|inline=1}}
#: {{usex|en|I '''got''' ski before.|I '''have''' skied before.|inline=1}}
#* {{quote-journal|en|author=Fiona Chan|newspaper=[[w:The Straits Times|The Sunday Times]]|location=Singapore|page=13|date=22 August 2010|text=You '''got''' send [e-mail] {{l|en|meh|id=interrogative}}? I never receive [[leh#Particle|leh]].}}
